---
---
<section class="section-final-marketing" id="inquiry">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fm-wrapper">
      
      <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background: transparent; border-color: var(--text-dark); color: var(--brand-navy); border-radius: 0;">
        Next step
      </span>
      
      <h2 class="fm-title">
        Ce trebuie să comunice compania dumneavoastră mai clar sau să obțină mai bine?
      </h2>
      
      <p class="fm-desc">
        Descrieți situația actuală, ce există deja și ce doriți să schimbați. Gabriel Pop va analiza personal cererea.
      </p>
      
      <div class="fm-action-wrapper">
        <a href="/contact/" class="fm-cta">
          Discutați proiectul de marketing
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="fm-reassurance">
        <img src="/images/gabriel-antonio-pop.png" alt="Gabriel Pop" class="fm-avatar">
        <span>Gabriel Pop vă va răspunde personal.</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-final-marketing {
    padding: 8rem 0 10rem;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .fm-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .fm-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .fm-desc {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .fm-action-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--brand-navy);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .fm-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .fm-cta:hover {
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }
  .fm-cta svg {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .fm-cta:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(12px);
  }

  .fm-reassurance {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .fm-avatar {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fm-cta svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
